### Create a Category
POST http://localhost:8081/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Greece Destinations",
  "description": "Explore the beautiful islands and mainland of Greece"
}

###

### Get All Categories
GET http://localhost:8081/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Register a New Admin User
POST http://localhost:8081/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@travelmag.com",
  "password": "securepassword123",
  "fullName": "Mavro Admin",
  "role": "ADMIN",
  "subscriptionType": "PRO"
}

### Create a New Article
POST http://localhost:8081/api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Hidden Gems of Crete",
  "content": "In this article, we explore the south side of Crete...",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "authorId": 1,
  "isPremium": true
}

### Subscribe to Newsletter
POST http://localhost:8081/api/newsletter/subscribe
Content-Type: text/plain

"test@example.com"

### Upload an Image
POST http://localhost:8081/api/images/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="me.png"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./me.png
--WebAppBoundary--